  For Unsupported Models                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                              
  If you pass a model type not in this list, ShardFormer raises:                                                                                                                                                                                           
                  
  NotImplementedError: Auto policy for MyModel is not implemented.                                                                                                                                                                                         
  Supported models are [...]                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  You can still use HybridParallelPlugin with an unsupported model by writing a custom policy:
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  from colossalai.shardformer.policies.base_policy import Policy
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  class MyModelPolicy(Policy):            
      def config_sanity_check(self): ...                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
      def preprocess(self): ...                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
      def module_policy(self): ...   # define how to shard each layer
      def postprocess(self): ...                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  plugin = HybridParallelPlugin(              
      pp_size=4, tp_size=2,                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
      custom_policy=MyModelPolicy()
  )                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                          
  The custom policy tells ShardFormer which layers to split column/row-wise for TP and how to assign layers to pipeline stages for PP.               